---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";

import wb from "~/images/Writers-Block-IG-Square-1024x1024.png";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="nv-page-title">
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-5xl">Writer’s Block</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-6">
    <div class="wp-block-image is-style-default wp-duotone-unset-1">
      <Picture src={wb} layout="constrained" width={600} alt="Writer's Block" />
    </div>

    <p>
      <strong>WRITER’S BLOCK</strong> is our monthly penpal co-working session,
      where penpals get together to write/type their letters, meet other
      penpals, support each other, and add letter-writing to our calendars so it
      doesn’t fall to the wayside.
    </p>

    <p>
      We’ve often heard from outside penpals that they struggle to find time to
      sit down and write letters. These sessions were created specifically to
      address that need! A member of the PCP Collective is always there to
      facilitate, and will be happy to answer questions about penpal-ing.
    </p>

    <p>
      You have to register in advance for Writer’s Block using the link below.
      We will send you a reminder email before the session, and let you know
      when next sessions are planned.
    </p>

    <p>
      We meet on the fourth Wednesday of every month, from 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET
    </p>

    <h2 class="wp-block-heading">Join us for Writer’s Block 2026:</h2>

    <p>
      All Writer’s Block sessions use the same Zoom link!{" "}
      <a href="https://concordia-ca.zoom.us/meeting/register/I9foQBcmRIqO5jfIivs8oQ">
        <strong>Register here.</strong>
      </a>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Upcoming dates:</strong>
    </p>

    <p>Oct 21, 2026 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET</p>

    <p>Nov 25, 2026 5-6pm PT / 8-9pm ET</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
